        "y": 26
      },
      "description": "THE PUNCHLINE. /healthz touches nothing and does no work, yet it gets slower when pairings is busy. That is the single Node.js thread being held hostage. Turn BLEND_ITERATIONS up to 40000000 and watch this panel, not the pairings one.",
      "targets": [
